WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:26.109
<i>Even in the seemingly endless</i>
<i>dark tunnels</i>

2
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.195
<i>there is light at the end.</i>

3
00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:52.677
<i>Light in the darkness -</i>
<i>that's what cinema was for me.</i>

4
00:00:55.430 --> 00:01:00.685
<i>In this simple</i>
<i>everything was possible for the shimmering square.</i>

5
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.939
<i>I felt that I was capable of anything.</i>

6
00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:13.239
<i>But the world beyond cinema</i>
<i>was always hard and burdensome.</i>

7
00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.743
<i>No elaborate plots</i>

8
00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:20.371
<i>or touching words.</i>

9
00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.249
<i>Life was lonely</i>

10
00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:26.336
<i>and desolate.</i>

11
00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:33.176
<i>And then someone appeared.</i>

12
00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:36.179
<i>Kim Mubi.</i>

13
00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.159
<i>I don't know if she's worried</i>
<i>the same darkness as me.</i>

14
00:02:00.161 --> 00:02:01.162
<i>But most importantly...</i>

15
00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:05.041
<i>I don't like the shimmering square anymore...</i>

16
00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:14.717
<i>I love Kim Mubi.</i>

17
00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:27.897
If I tell a secret
will you still like me

18
00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:30.441
Won't you leave me?

19
00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.996
I think dad died because of me.

20
00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:55.133
<i>Sometimes you realize something only then,</i>
<i>when you say it out loud.</i>

21
00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:14.277
<i>I thought I ran away from the past</i>
<i>but I was wrong.</i>

22
00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:20.033
<i>Everything begins</i>
<i>from something insignificant and simple.</i>

23
00:03:20.783 --> 00:03:22.368
<i>I was a child...</i>

24
00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.120
Mom, dad at home?

25
00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:27.540
He sent you a gift
to the birthday

26
00:03:28.249 --> 00:03:29.250
Open it.

27
00:03:32.795 --> 00:03:36.466
<i>…who wanted to be loved. That's all.</i>

28
00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:40.803
<i>I didn't ask too much, did I?</i>

29
00:03:41.971 --> 00:03:44.098
<i>- Whoever solves more wins!</i>
<i>- Okay.</i>

30
00:03:47.644 --> 00:03:48.519
<i>Wait for me.</i>

31
00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:04.994
<i>He could at least pretend better.</i>

32
00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.290
Dad, at the end of the movie…

33
00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:16.172
- Are you director Kim Sung-hwan?
- Yes.

34
00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:18.508
I am your big fan.

35
00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:21.594
I didn't think I would meet you.
Can I shake your hand?

36
00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:23.596
I also make movies.

37
00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.641
- True? Thank you.
- Yes.

38
00:04:26.724 --> 00:04:30.645
I really enjoyed your new movie.
How did you get to…

39
00:04:30.728 --> 00:04:32.605
<i>The child who was never loved...</i>

40
00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:33.606
I was amazed.

41
00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.608
Are you here alone?

42
00:04:35.692 --> 00:04:37.485
No. I came with my daughter.

43
00:04:39.404 --> 00:04:43.533
<i>…will live his whole life</i>
<i>with the thought that it is her fault.</i>

44
00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:44.993
Mubi!

45
00:04:48.496 --> 00:04:53.751
But then I realized
that hating dad would be better.

46
00:04:54.836 --> 00:04:57.005
So I hated him as much as I could.

47
00:04:57.505 --> 00:04:59.090
It was not easy

48
00:04:59.173 --> 00:05:02.719
hate that
who appeared only from time to time

49
00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.595
and was kind to me.

50
00:05:06.264 --> 00:05:08.182
But I wasn't going to back down.

51
00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.979
Mubi, where's your dad?

52
00:05:13.062 --> 00:05:15.690
I don't have a dad. He died.

53
00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:19.319
I'm serious.

54
00:05:24.032 --> 00:05:24.866
Mubi!

55
00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:28.828
Mubi, is that your dad?

56
00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:32.498
No, I don't know this man.

57
00:05:36.627 --> 00:05:38.463
I wonder what little Mubi was like.

58
00:05:38.546 --> 00:05:41.215
It was much more difficult with her than with me.

59
00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:50.016
But I guess you get used to hating.

60
00:05:51.559 --> 00:05:53.895
I wanted to see him less and less.

61
00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:57.607
We were moving away...

62
00:05:59.984 --> 00:06:01.569
and that suited me.

63
00:06:26.969 --> 00:06:27.970
<i>But...</i>

64
00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:39.065
<i>I didn't want to see him like that.</i>

65
00:06:39.607 --> 00:06:42.360
{\an8}FOUR-LEAF CLOVER

66
00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.655
<i>It was strange.</i>

67
00:06:53.162 --> 00:06:55.415
<i>As if my insides were agitated.</i>

68
00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:58.126
Stop now at last!

69
00:06:58.209 --> 00:07:00.461
No one will help you.

70
00:07:00.545 --> 00:07:04.632
<i>The director promised to help,</i>
<i>when we finish the project.</i>

71
00:07:04.715 --> 00:07:05.800
<i>He spoke sincerely.</i>

72
00:07:05.883 --> 00:07:08.886
And you believed him again?
When you do that, I…

73
00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.684
You can continue chasing movies.

74
00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:16.769
Don't force yourself to be a father.

75
00:07:16.853 --> 00:07:18.688
I don't care.

76
00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:20.857
<i>I will come tomorrow</i>

77
00:07:21.732 --> 00:07:23.276
<i>for my little girl's birthday.</i>

78
00:07:23.359 --> 00:07:24.777
I'm not a child anymore.

79
00:07:24.861 --> 00:07:28.531
<i>I'm sorry I wasn't there</i>
<i>when you were little.</i>

80
00:07:28.614 --> 00:07:33.035
<i>You have to come quickly, before you let</i>
<i>another rumor that your dad is dead.</i>

81
00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:37.123
I did so
because I thought you might show up

82
00:07:37.206 --> 00:07:38.207
but not anymore.

83
00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:41.878
I haven't thought for a long time
that I don't have a dad.

84
00:07:41.961 --> 00:07:44.380
<i>Mubi, I'm sorry.</i>

85
00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:48.050
<i>- What should I do to fix everything?</i>
- Are you serious?

86
00:07:48.759 --> 00:07:51.220
Stop filming and come home.

87
00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:52.555
can you

88
00:08:11.073 --> 00:08:11.908
Hello.

89
00:08:12.825 --> 00:08:13.701
Yes.

90
00:08:32.929 --> 00:08:33.846
Mubi.

91
00:08:35.431 --> 00:08:39.685
Dad had an accident.

92
00:08:46.025 --> 00:08:48.027
I was cruel to him.

93
00:08:51.113 --> 00:08:55.535
I thought he was pathetic
I was ashamed of him.

94
00:08:57.495 --> 00:09:00.498
I knew it would hurt
and said it anyway.

95
00:09:01.749 --> 00:09:05.753
I also suffered, so I thought
that I have the right to behave like that.

96
00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:10.633
But I didn't want him to die.

97
00:09:11.801 --> 00:09:13.386
Fair. I just…

98
00:09:15.555 --> 00:09:17.765
I just wanted him to love me.

99
00:09:57.346 --> 00:09:58.764
EPISODE 10

100
00:09:58.848 --> 00:10:04.270
LIFE IS WONDERFUL AND AMAZING,
EVEN IF YOU'RE A JELLYFISH

101
00:10:08.941 --> 00:10:13.696
I thought that when I confess
something incredible will happen.

102
00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:18.367
But nothing happened. I'm so stupid.

103
00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.371
It didn't happen.

104
00:10:23.914 --> 00:10:24.915
And that's good.

105
00:10:24.999 --> 00:10:27.418
It's strange, but I feel that way about you.

106
00:10:28.961 --> 00:10:30.713
Everything is fine with me.

107
00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:37.887
Then and in the future, be by my side, as now.

108
00:10:51.734 --> 00:10:52.985
What are you thinking about?

109
00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:56.989
About nothing.

110
00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:00.326
About us

111
00:11:01.702 --> 00:11:02.787
I'm thinking about us.

112
00:11:05.748 --> 00:11:07.500
It's so beautiful here.

113
00:11:08.376 --> 00:11:10.628
Shall we stay until dawn?

114
00:11:11.629 --> 00:11:15.257
your mother will hate me
if you spend the night away from home.

115
00:11:17.677 --> 00:11:20.513
Maybe it's a can
but I'm glad we went.

116
00:11:21.013 --> 00:11:22.306
This tin can hear you.

117
00:11:23.599 --> 00:11:26.018
Why do you drive such an old car?

118
00:11:26.519 --> 00:11:29.605
Because it's cool.
Such cars are used in movies.

119
00:11:31.691 --> 00:11:34.902
People love movies too much.

120
00:11:35.986 --> 00:11:37.571
Why do you like movies?

121
00:11:41.534 --> 00:11:44.203
I fell in love with cinema because I was afraid to be alone.

122
00:11:48.457 --> 00:11:52.461
And later it was that
what I could do with Chun.

123
00:12:02.012 --> 00:12:02.888
Gomme.

124
00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:06.475
And what is your secret?

125
00:12:10.813 --> 00:12:12.064
My secret?

126
00:12:13.482 --> 00:12:14.650
Well…

127
00:12:19.822 --> 00:12:20.906
He is dark.

128
00:12:22.908 --> 00:12:25.286
He is difficult to bear, he is depressed.

129
00:12:26.454 --> 00:12:27.455
And unpleasant.

130
00:12:29.123 --> 00:12:30.374
I still want to hear.

131
00:12:38.174 --> 00:12:42.178
When I was little, I was afraid to be alone.

132
00:12:44.054 --> 00:12:47.349
I watched the video ad nauseum
until Chun came home.

133
00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.313
It was hard to pretend to be happy all the time.

134
00:12:53.063 --> 00:12:55.691
You were little. You could complain.

135
00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:58.110
I was afraid that Chun would disappear then.

136
00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:02.615
Even as a child it was clear to me

137
00:13:03.657 --> 00:13:06.494
that Chun could disappear at any moment.

138
00:13:10.456 --> 00:13:13.709
You were too kind, Goem.

139
00:13:16.003 --> 00:13:17.171
I'm not good.

140
00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:21.300
when i realized
that he tried to commit suicide

141
00:13:21.842 --> 00:13:23.302
I pretended I didn't know anything.

142
00:13:24.553 --> 00:13:26.013
I was silent until the end

143
00:13:27.473 --> 00:13:29.099
because I thought it was because of me.

144
00:13:31.393 --> 00:13:32.478
Gomme.

145
00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:33.729
do you see

146
00:13:35.564 --> 00:13:36.816
My secret...

147
00:13:39.026 --> 00:13:40.861
depressed and cowardly.

148
00:13:49.578 --> 00:13:50.913
One problem with us.

149
00:13:53.082 --> 00:13:53.916
Truth?

150
00:13:57.169 --> 00:13:59.004
I think death is…

151
00:14:03.801 --> 00:14:04.969
lousy

152
00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.306
Yes.

153
00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:12.434
So it is.

154
00:14:58.647 --> 00:15:00.900
What? Why is the door unlocked...

155
00:15:02.192 --> 00:15:03.027
Congratulations

156
00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.195
Greetings. Did you rest well yesterday?

157
00:15:05.279 --> 00:15:07.656
You asked for a few days off. why are you here

158
00:15:08.532 --> 00:15:09.867
There was nothing to do.

159
00:15:15.039 --> 00:15:17.583
It doesn't look like you enjoyed your vacation.

160
00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:19.585
What happened?

161
00:15:24.673 --> 00:15:25.591
San Siku.

162
00:15:25.674 --> 00:15:26.508
What?

163
00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.306
What were we in your eyes?

164
00:15:33.557 --> 00:15:35.059
When they were together with Chu A.

165
00:15:35.142 --> 00:15:37.561
leave it I can't say.

166
00:15:38.562 --> 00:15:41.982
You will sulk again. This is a forbidden topic.

167
00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:44.276
Tell me.

168
00:15:45.527 --> 00:15:46.445
are you serious

169
00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:51.283
I only say because you ask

170
00:15:51.367 --> 00:15:53.535
but you - that was something!

171
00:15:53.619 --> 00:15:57.039
You walked around with a guitar on your back.

172
00:15:57.122 --> 00:16:00.167
She was packing snacks
and ran after you with her tail.

173
00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.836
In my opinion, Chu Ah was not your girlfriend.

174
00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.922
She was like a mother to you. No.

175
00:16:05.422 --> 00:16:08.092
More like a fan.

176
00:16:08.175 --> 00:16:11.887
But she never got tired.
I will give her credit.

177
00:16:11.971 --> 00:16:12.888
Really?

178
00:16:15.474 --> 00:16:17.559
Well, just…

179
00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:20.396
It seemed so from the side.

180
00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:24.233
Do you know how you got on my nerves?

181
00:16:24.316 --> 00:16:27.569
Only heard:
“Song Chu And this, Song Chu And that.

182
00:16:27.653 --> 00:16:30.698
I will eat with Chu Ah. I will walk with Chu Ah.”

183
00:16:30.781 --> 00:16:34.201
Except for the time you worked here
or over music

184
00:16:34.284 --> 00:16:36.912
you literally did not leave that girl.

185
00:16:36.996 --> 00:16:39.832
I even thought:
"How can a guy be like that?"

186
00:16:50.259 --> 00:16:52.678
You were a great couple.

187
00:16:54.179 --> 00:16:55.472
That's what I'm talking about.

188
00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:02.563
This is possible only at this age.

189
00:17:04.606 --> 00:17:09.319
Do you think you will ever love like this?
Or will you have such a relationship again?

190
00:17:11.113 --> 00:17:15.951
I think you are very lucky to have met.

191
00:17:18.954 --> 00:17:22.708
do you hear God is merciful.

192
00:17:26.086 --> 00:17:28.172
I understood.

193
00:17:29.089 --> 00:17:30.841
You saw Chu Ah yesterday, right?

194
00:17:33.969 --> 00:17:36.305
I wanted to ask if we still have a chance...

195
00:17:38.932 --> 00:17:40.267
but I don't know anymore.

196
00:17:45.481 --> 00:17:46.482
Si Chun.

197
00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:50.652
What makes love perfect?

198
00:17:59.703 --> 00:18:00.537
Marriage?

199
00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:03.373
Death in one day?

200
00:18:03.457 --> 00:18:05.876
You are wrong.

201
00:18:07.211 --> 00:18:10.631
Love is so perfect.

202
00:18:12.007 --> 00:18:13.092
Is it clear to you?

203
00:18:13.967 --> 00:18:17.471
If your love was great,
you should be happy

204
00:18:17.971 --> 00:18:22.142
You know how many romantic movies there are
did i watch while running a video store?

205
00:18:22.226 --> 00:18:25.437
I'm an expert on love.
That's why I have no rejection from women.

206
00:18:26.438 --> 00:18:29.900
Finish cleaning. I wonder how the kitchen is there.

207
00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.194
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH
LET'S ALWAYS BE HAPPY

208
00:19:23.245 --> 00:19:25.831
{\an8}CHU A, IT'S ME, HONSI
HAPPY BIRTHDAY

209
00:19:37.593 --> 00:19:40.262
THANK YOU FOR BEING IN MY LIFE
AND YOU STAY WITH ME, MY LOVE!

210
00:19:58.989 --> 00:20:00.741
LOVE!

211
00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:17.132
Good afternoon, ma'am.

212
00:20:17.883 --> 00:20:19.009
what are you doing here

213
00:20:19.092 --> 00:20:21.220
I was just about to call.

214
00:20:21.303 --> 00:20:22.804
Mubi is still sleeping.

215
00:20:22.888 --> 00:20:25.098
I know I came to you.

216
00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:34.524
This is for you.

217
00:20:35.817 --> 00:20:37.569
Flowers? Why suddenly?

218
00:20:38.237 --> 00:20:39.947
Did you come to give me flowers?

219
00:20:47.496 --> 00:20:48.830
Why all this?

220
00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:50.749
I heard you like flowers.

221
00:20:50.832 --> 00:20:54.586
Therefore, I took only the ones that are easier
grow as a gift…

222
00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:55.879
are you crazy

223
00:20:55.963 --> 00:20:58.674
What should I do about it? Who will plant them?

224
00:21:13.981 --> 00:21:16.275
Sorry, I didn't know you were still here.

225
00:21:16.858 --> 00:21:20.445
Didn't notice you among the flowers.

226
00:21:20.529 --> 00:21:21.697
shut up

227
00:21:22.531 --> 00:21:23.365
Yes, ma'am.

228
00:21:26.201 --> 00:21:29.204
You understand what the neighbors will think

229
00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:30.998
if Mubi will always be with you?

230
00:21:32.332 --> 00:21:35.002
So maybe I'll be here all the time?

231
00:21:35.085 --> 00:21:36.128
What do you think?

232
00:21:37.421 --> 00:21:38.839
See you somewhere else.

233
00:21:42.384 --> 00:21:45.804
Leave space between the flowers.

234
00:21:45.887 --> 00:21:48.932
Can you show how it is done?

235
00:21:51.226 --> 00:21:52.060
Probably not.

236
00:21:53.562 --> 00:21:55.230
You can go home.

237
00:22:03.238 --> 00:22:08.035
You said you think too much
but it's hard for you to talk about it.

238
00:22:09.453 --> 00:22:10.746
Are you still like this?

239
00:22:12.372 --> 00:22:14.458
I decided to change.

240
00:22:17.252 --> 00:22:20.756
Good. Say whatever you want to say.

241
00:22:22.007 --> 00:22:23.467
Something can only be completed in this way.

242
00:22:36.772 --> 00:22:37.689
And if...

243
00:22:39.983 --> 00:22:41.735
is there no one who should hear it?

244
00:22:44.988 --> 00:22:47.074
They are here even if we can't see them.

245
00:22:52.496 --> 00:22:54.831
I hoped
that Mubi will meet someone simpler,

246
00:22:54.915 --> 00:22:57.459
but she met one just like herself.

247
00:23:01.755 --> 00:23:04.257
I'm simple when with Mubi.

248
00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:09.721
Then listen to what's on my girl's mind.

249
00:23:10.722 --> 00:23:12.391
She has no one to lean on.

250
00:23:13.892 --> 00:23:14.976
Really?

251
00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:18.980
It seems to depend on you
more than you think.

252
00:23:21.316 --> 00:23:25.737
I have to open a shop
so finish here.

253
00:24:44.941 --> 00:24:47.194
<i>Your mom likes me again!</i>

254
00:25:24.773 --> 00:25:26.525
why are you sitting here

255
00:25:45.710 --> 00:25:47.879
He did a great job.

256
00:25:49.381 --> 00:25:50.715
Isn't Golem cute?

257
00:25:52.634 --> 00:25:53.718
Not a bit

258
00:25:55.804 --> 00:25:57.389
But he's a good guy.

259
00:26:07.482 --> 00:26:10.068
What kind of person was dad for you?

260
00:26:10.860 --> 00:26:13.863
He was a miserable and stupid man.

261
00:26:14.447 --> 00:26:18.785
I was unhappy longer than I was happy.

262
00:26:20.912 --> 00:26:25.333
But some people in this world are just like that.

263
00:26:26.334 --> 00:26:29.504
They lack talent
do what they love

264
00:26:30.005 --> 00:26:34.342
and intelligence to know when to back off.

265
00:26:39.681 --> 00:26:44.519
But if it wasn't for you
he would have given up much earlier.

266
00:26:47.939 --> 00:26:51.234
He always wanted to show you

267
00:26:53.069 --> 00:26:55.572
how well he could tell his story...

268
00:26:58.617 --> 00:27:00.493
and that he never gives up.

269
00:27:04.080 --> 00:27:05.040
That's a fool.

270
00:27:05.915 --> 00:27:07.083
But you know...

271
00:27:09.419 --> 00:27:11.588
you look more like dad

272
00:27:12.172 --> 00:27:16.676
What? What are you talking about? I look like you.

273
00:27:17.344 --> 00:27:19.429
You don't know how cute you are.

274
00:27:22.057 --> 00:27:25.060
I see it in your movie.

275
00:27:26.102 --> 00:27:29.105
You are as kind-hearted as your father.

276
00:27:31.650 --> 00:27:37.656
So I want to see more of your movies.

277
00:27:59.135 --> 00:28:00.136
Mom

278
00:28:01.262 --> 00:28:02.263
You know…

279
00:28:04.474 --> 00:28:06.309
I have something to say.

280
00:28:06.393 --> 00:28:07.227
Mubi.

281
00:28:11.231 --> 00:28:12.315
I'm sorry...

282
00:28:16.403 --> 00:28:18.071
that was not kind to you.

283
00:28:19.864 --> 00:28:25.078
<i>At such moments I realize that I am still a child.</i>

284
00:28:25.578 --> 00:28:28.164
It wouldn't be so hard for you

285
00:28:29.290 --> 00:28:31.876
if I were kinder to you

286
00:28:32.711 --> 00:28:34.546
but I couldn't.

287
00:28:36.881 --> 00:28:38.299
Not even close.

288
00:28:43.596 --> 00:28:44.514
I'm sorry

289
00:28:47.142 --> 00:28:51.229
<i>I was too immersed in my pain</i>
<i>and did not see those who were nearby.</i>

290
00:29:26.097 --> 00:29:29.225
{\an8}FROM A LOVING DAD

291
00:29:31.811 --> 00:29:32.937
Am I not late?

292
00:29:34.189 --> 00:29:35.690
I had to close the shop.

293
00:29:35.774 --> 00:29:36.858
Did dad leave again?

294
00:29:37.525 --> 00:29:40.195
What did you want to see? Let's see together.

295
00:29:40.278 --> 00:29:44.199
I can see it myself.
You never go to the movies, mom.

296
00:29:44.282 --> 00:29:46.034
Do you know who Batman is?

297
00:29:46.117 --> 00:29:49.996
Of course. He's one of those guys
who fly in their underpants.

298
00:29:51.623 --> 00:29:53.792
Not just one of those guys.

299
00:29:53.875 --> 00:29:57.212
And you haven't seen the previous movies,
you will not understand anything.

300
00:29:57.295 --> 00:29:59.672
I will understand when I look. Where? Come on.

301
00:29:59.756 --> 00:30:00.757
Here.

302
00:30:01.299 --> 00:30:02.217
Come on.

303
00:31:06.698 --> 00:31:11.703
<i>Why didn't I see that I was never alone</i>
<i>and there were always two of us?</i>

304
00:31:28.344 --> 00:31:29.345
Everything is fine.

305
00:31:30.388 --> 00:31:31.723
It's okay, Mubi.

306
00:31:34.058 --> 00:31:35.310
It's not your fault.

307
00:31:39.022 --> 00:31:40.273
Don't you hate me?

308
00:31:42.609 --> 00:31:44.027
How can I hate you?

309
00:31:46.070 --> 00:31:48.406
Why am I so stupid?

310
00:31:49.574 --> 00:31:52.744
sorry for complaining
that I was never loved.

311
00:31:53.453 --> 00:31:55.705
I'm sorry for behaving like a child.

312
00:31:56.205 --> 00:32:02.462
I'm sorry for what I perceived
your love for granted, mother.

313
00:32:03.421 --> 00:32:07.675
I'm sorry that I didn't show you
more love

314
00:32:09.052 --> 00:32:11.220
You gave everything to me.

315
00:32:19.187 --> 00:32:20.188
I will try to be

316
00:32:21.856 --> 00:32:23.441
the best mother for you.

317
00:32:26.152 --> 00:32:30.323
You won't be hurt anymore.

318
00:32:32.450 --> 00:32:36.788
You think we are with you
can we start living happily?

319
00:32:38.957 --> 00:32:39.832
Yes.

320
00:32:47.465 --> 00:32:48.716
Mom…

321
00:34:42.163 --> 00:34:44.165
Why do you want to sell them to me?

322
00:34:44.248 --> 00:34:46.501
They are very valuable.

323
00:34:46.584 --> 00:34:49.003
- Something is not the same.
- They look like you.

324
00:34:50.463 --> 00:34:54.217
Who is watching tapes now?
I don't even have a record player.

325
00:34:54.300 --> 00:34:56.511
Consider it shelf decor.

326
00:34:57.512 --> 00:34:59.806
- You are putting pressure on me.
- That's stupid.

327
00:34:59.889 --> 00:35:01.015
You said to pay.

328
00:35:01.099 --> 00:35:04.185
Almost crazy. Just pay for shipping.

329
00:35:04.268 --> 00:35:07.146
I have to take them home
and pay you for shipping?

330
00:35:07.230 --> 00:35:10.399
Don't be so smart and callous.

331
00:35:10.483 --> 00:35:13.069
- What are you saying? forget it
- Wait!

332
00:35:14.695 --> 00:35:16.864
You are so clumsy.

333
00:35:16.948 --> 00:35:18.783
- What is it? Raise your leg.
- Why?

334
00:35:18.866 --> 00:35:19.784
That's it.

335
00:35:19.867 --> 00:35:20.952
Everything is fine. Climb up

336
00:35:22.203 --> 00:35:25.706
Everything is fine. go Pay later.

337
00:35:26.332 --> 00:35:27.667
I look funny.

338
00:35:27.750 --> 00:35:30.128
It suits you. Go already.

339
00:35:30.211 --> 00:35:34.632
When you pick it up, I'll sell it
the next party to his patron.

340
00:35:37.802 --> 00:35:39.554
- Come on.
- Okay.

341
00:35:41.180 --> 00:35:42.765
wait Why did you take it away?

342
00:35:42.849 --> 00:35:44.559
You already have too much.

343
00:35:45.226 --> 00:35:46.394
Well, you give.

344
00:35:57.196 --> 00:36:00.741
Director Ma, where are you?
I asked you to come here quickly.

345
00:36:10.960 --> 00:36:12.128
My God!

346
00:36:12.211 --> 00:36:13.379
You scared me.

347
00:36:14.255 --> 00:36:16.090
why are you here

348
00:36:16.883 --> 00:36:18.718
How did you know where I live?

349
00:36:18.801 --> 00:36:22.096
"Sorry, we can't
continue the project".

350
00:36:22.597 --> 00:36:23.514
And that's all?

351
00:36:23.598 --> 00:36:26.559
Do you just disappear? Are you out of your mind?

352
00:36:27.059 --> 00:36:29.478
I thought about it a little more.

353
00:36:29.562 --> 00:36:30.730
Indifferently.

354
00:36:31.439 --> 00:36:34.233
I don't understand how you can give up

355
00:36:34.317 --> 00:36:36.527
without even trying to find a solution.

356
00:36:36.611 --> 00:36:39.322
Because you are always ready
take on another project?

357
00:36:39.822 --> 00:36:42.325
Would you just dump everyone who was with you?

358
00:36:42.408 --> 00:36:44.577
I didn't think you were like that.

359
00:36:44.660 --> 00:36:48.873
You knew I didn't want to get involved
for this project, but insisted.

360
00:36:51.417 --> 00:36:53.294
To be more precise,

361
00:36:53.377 --> 00:36:55.671
you were ashamed to make a film.

362
00:36:56.505 --> 00:36:57.673
Seriously?

363
00:36:57.757 --> 00:37:02.011
You have to find a way out.
We can go to the production company.

364
00:37:04.096 --> 00:37:05.097
No.

365
00:37:05.806 --> 00:37:08.184
You're not going anywhere until you answer.

366
00:37:08.976 --> 00:37:11.646
I wouldn't come
if it only applied to me.

367
00:37:11.729 --> 00:37:16.317
But some put everything into this project.

368
00:37:18.027 --> 00:37:19.987
You will have to step over me.

369
00:37:20.071 --> 00:37:23.407
Are you lying on the ground?

370
00:37:40.007 --> 00:37:41.300
That lousy Kim Mubi!

371
00:37:42.218 --> 00:37:43.469
What did you call me?

372
00:37:43.552 --> 00:37:46.180
You heard me. The film has been cancelled.
You are not my director.

373
00:37:47.098 --> 00:37:50.184
I realized that you are annoying
as soon as we met

374
00:37:50.268 --> 00:37:52.353
but you are even worse than I imagined.

375
00:37:52.436 --> 00:37:55.273
You said I looked like a civil servant.

376
00:37:55.356 --> 00:37:57.608
If only You look like a drunkard.

377
00:37:57.692 --> 00:38:00.444
"The drunkard"? Who would have said!

378
00:38:00.528 --> 00:38:01.445
What?

379
00:38:10.579 --> 00:38:14.458
I'm going to find a solution.
Come with me or stay here.

380
00:38:16.127 --> 00:38:19.130
Just now? Decision? Where are we going?

381
00:38:20.464 --> 00:38:22.717
Director Kim, wait!

382
00:38:26.512 --> 00:38:28.347
I didn't think we would meet again.

383
00:38:28.431 --> 00:38:31.100
Did you come to talk about the contract?

384
00:38:31.183 --> 00:38:32.435
I didn't think so either.

385
00:38:32.518 --> 00:38:35.479
Perhaps the producers will contact you.

386
00:38:38.566 --> 00:38:39.734
Then why are you here?

387
00:38:40.318 --> 00:38:43.529
To say that she listened to music
which you sent yesterday

388
00:38:44.697 --> 00:38:46.032
Music? What music?

389
00:38:47.533 --> 00:38:48.451
It's just…

390
00:38:48.534 --> 00:38:50.870
Did you send it to make me change my mind?

391
00:38:55.666 --> 00:38:56.584
No.

392
00:38:57.335 --> 00:39:00.421
Then why?

393
00:39:06.010 --> 00:39:07.386
When I wrote this music…

394
00:39:11.515 --> 00:39:12.516
i was happy

395
00:39:14.643 --> 00:39:17.396
I don't remember the last time I felt this way.

396
00:39:19.106 --> 00:39:21.025
It was a good feeling.

397
00:39:29.950 --> 00:39:34.538
I took on this project,
to end everything with it.

398
00:39:35.456 --> 00:39:38.042
This should have been a reason to leave that…

399
00:39:40.669 --> 00:39:42.588
that I've been clinging to for far too long.

400
00:39:51.389 --> 00:39:54.558
Everything ends anyway.

401
00:39:59.647 --> 00:40:03.317
But the music made me feel something.

402
00:40:05.361 --> 00:40:06.320
I was glad.

403
00:40:11.617 --> 00:40:12.952
I sent this music

404
00:40:14.537 --> 00:40:16.872
because I didn't think she belonged to me.

405
00:40:21.127 --> 00:40:25.047
Then hold this thought a little longer.

406
00:40:26.507 --> 00:40:29.260
you need
complete everything properly.

407
00:40:31.846 --> 00:40:34.098
I'm not giving up yet

408
00:40:34.181 --> 00:40:36.600
because music
the one you sent me is very beautiful.

409
00:40:37.184 --> 00:40:40.229
Of course, there are other reasons

410
00:40:40.729 --> 00:40:46.652
but i was listening to your music yesterday
and this is the very first reason.

411
00:40:50.072 --> 00:40:52.783
So you will try to make a film?

412
00:40:54.034 --> 00:40:56.287
You just have to figure out how.

413
00:40:56.370 --> 00:41:00.291
Looking for an investor yourself
to protest near the production company

414
00:41:00.791 --> 00:41:03.627
or cut the budget to a minimum.

415
00:41:04.128 --> 00:41:05.504
I'll think of something.

416
00:41:05.588 --> 00:41:08.174
Thank you in advance for your support.

417
00:41:09.467 --> 00:41:10.551
So cool.

418
00:41:11.594 --> 00:41:14.388
I just don't know if it's the music preference
above the script is good.

419
00:41:14.472 --> 00:41:15.806
Director Kim!

420
00:41:17.224 --> 00:41:18.726
Am I your director again?

421
00:41:18.809 --> 00:41:21.145
Now you are my favorite director.

422
00:41:25.149 --> 00:41:26.901
I'll ask just in case.

423
00:41:27.651 --> 00:41:31.071
Do you sometimes not have much savings?

424
00:41:34.825 --> 00:41:35.826
Just kidding.

425
00:41:36.827 --> 00:41:39.330
You would see your faces. It's unpleasant.

426
00:41:59.266 --> 00:42:01.560
think well

427
00:42:02.853 --> 00:42:04.980
or drop the music after that.

428
00:42:08.943 --> 00:42:09.777
OK.

429
00:42:10.945 --> 00:42:13.364
I hope you don't.

430
00:42:15.032 --> 00:42:15.950
I'm serious.

431
00:42:28.420 --> 00:42:29.255
bye

432
00:43:58.385 --> 00:44:00.220
I'll put a full stop after that.

433
00:44:02.306 --> 00:44:04.350
You said you wouldn't be in a hurry.

434
00:44:14.777 --> 00:44:17.529
You weren't talking about music.

435
00:44:20.324 --> 00:44:21.158
No.

436
00:44:23.827 --> 00:44:24.662
OK.

437
00:44:26.288 --> 00:44:29.041
Looks like I've been holding on to the past for too long.

438
00:44:36.382 --> 00:44:39.009
I think we're really going to part ways.

439
00:44:41.011 --> 00:44:41.845
Yes.

440
00:44:43.430 --> 00:44:44.682
And then...

441
00:44:51.105 --> 00:44:52.690
let's not see each other again.

442
00:44:55.401 --> 00:44:57.820
No matter what the excuse, nothing will work.

443
00:44:59.863 --> 00:45:01.115
We will not be friends either.

444
00:45:04.535 --> 00:45:06.954
When I hear about you, I'll pretend I didn't hear.

445
00:45:09.957 --> 00:45:11.375
We will disappear…

446
00:45:15.838 --> 00:45:17.381
from each other's lives.

447
00:45:33.897 --> 00:45:34.982
But Chu Ah…

448
00:45:43.157 --> 00:45:45.909
then we won't do any of it.

449
00:45:53.417 --> 00:45:56.920
Fun conversations, silly jokes

450
00:45:57.671 --> 00:45:59.840
and talk until we fall asleep.

451
00:45:59.923 --> 00:46:01.842
This is what we do best.

452
00:46:01.925 --> 00:46:02.926
Si Chun.

453
00:46:03.719 --> 00:46:07.139
Can you live the rest of your life without it?

454
00:46:07.765 --> 00:46:09.850
You will miss it very much.

455
00:46:10.768 --> 00:46:14.146
Wake someone up just to talk.

456
00:46:14.646 --> 00:46:16.565
Not everyone likes it.

457
00:46:32.539 --> 00:46:33.957
How can I survive this?

458
00:46:37.795 --> 00:46:39.004
It will pass.

459
00:46:48.180 --> 00:46:49.014
Well…

460
00:46:53.769 --> 00:46:58.690
If I hurt you...

461
00:47:05.572 --> 00:47:07.074
We were good together.

462
00:47:45.362 --> 00:47:48.031
We were very good together, Xi Chun.

463
00:47:48.699 --> 00:47:49.783
Is it true?

464
00:51:22.579 --> 00:51:24.414
You don't do it like that. look

465
00:51:25.499 --> 00:51:27.250
It's like breathing.

466
00:51:29.753 --> 00:51:31.004
Breathe naturally.

467
00:51:40.180 --> 00:51:41.181
do you like

468
00:51:41.932 --> 00:51:43.809
And you are an example to follow.

469
00:51:47.062 --> 00:51:49.648
It's like you never
not caught smoking?

470
00:51:50.899 --> 00:51:53.652
You don't know much about me, kid.

471
00:52:25.392 --> 00:52:26.226
Chune

472
00:52:27.227 --> 00:52:28.061
What?

473
00:52:33.984 --> 00:52:35.152
do me a favor

474
00:52:38.029 --> 00:52:38.864
Which one?

475
00:52:40.240 --> 00:52:42.492
I still don't know much about you

476
00:52:43.994 --> 00:52:46.663
so visit me in your dreams
from time to time

477
00:52:47.914 --> 00:52:50.792
I won't get angry and I won't get it.

478
00:52:53.503 --> 00:52:55.505
I will let you do whatever you want.

479
00:53:02.304 --> 00:53:04.848
Why did you drink secretly?

480
00:53:04.931 --> 00:53:06.683
I should have been called.

481
00:53:10.645 --> 00:53:12.689
I want to have a drink with you too.

482
00:53:15.692 --> 00:53:19.112
The same goes for smoking.
I'll smoke with you if you want.

483
00:53:23.867 --> 00:53:24.868
So…

484
00:53:29.372 --> 00:53:30.373
sometimes…

485
00:53:36.796 --> 00:53:40.050
sometimes visit me in a dream.

486
00:53:42.677 --> 00:53:43.720
Let's hang out.

487
00:53:55.482 --> 00:53:57.150
What's funny?

488
00:54:00.820 --> 00:54:01.738
I know

489
00:54:03.490 --> 00:54:04.991
And it's funny to me.

490
00:54:08.245 --> 00:54:09.829
Why are you crying, Goem?

491
00:54:27.681 --> 00:54:29.724
Maybe you'll call me like you used to?

492
00:54:30.600 --> 00:54:33.019
But you still won't come.

493
00:54:41.695 --> 00:54:43.071
- Chune.
- What?

494
00:54:44.364 --> 00:54:49.035
There's something I couldn't tell you.

495
00:54:52.122 --> 00:54:54.374
Everything will be fine.

496
00:54:57.294 --> 00:54:58.670
Everything will be fine with me.

497
00:54:59.879 --> 00:55:01.631
Don't worry.

498
00:55:03.633 --> 00:55:06.720
I lived a happy life because of you.

499
00:55:09.472 --> 00:55:11.141
Therefore, I will try to live as best as possible.

500
00:56:46.111 --> 00:56:48.363
You are so gloomy, not like yourself.

501
00:56:51.574 --> 00:56:53.827
I was in a production company.

502
00:56:54.744 --> 00:56:57.497
I promised to find an investor,

503
00:56:57.580 --> 00:56:59.749
but how?

504
00:56:59.833 --> 00:57:02.335
I don't know where to get the money.

505
00:57:03.962 --> 00:57:04.879
What is it?

506
00:57:05.463 --> 00:57:08.258
do you see I knew you wouldn't give up.

507
00:57:14.264 --> 00:57:17.350
I watched my dad's movies again.

508
00:57:18.184 --> 00:57:21.271
They are still ugly and boring.

509
00:57:22.105 --> 00:57:25.233
But touching.

510
00:57:26.192 --> 00:57:28.945
I don't know what he wanted to say.

511
00:57:29.446 --> 00:57:33.450
So I plan to give it a try.
Maybe I'll find out later.

512
00:57:34.534 --> 00:57:35.452
Well done.

513
00:57:36.202 --> 00:57:39.789
But how do I do it?
if I don't have money?

514
00:57:40.582 --> 00:57:42.917
Where can I find an investor?

515
00:57:45.211 --> 00:57:48.381
I will sell all the tapes
and invest in your film.

516
00:57:49.132 --> 00:57:50.633
I know how cheap they are.

517
00:57:50.717 --> 00:57:52.635
Any help is important.

518
00:57:54.762 --> 00:57:56.097
Why are you selling them?

519
00:57:57.682 --> 00:58:00.602
I've watched enough movies.

520
00:58:02.061 --> 00:58:05.482
I set myself a goal
watch all movies

521
00:58:06.983 --> 00:58:09.110
But now I am more interested in the world.

522
00:58:11.529 --> 00:58:14.365
It sounded a bit philosophical.

523
00:58:14.449 --> 00:58:15.617
Cool, say?

524
00:58:15.700 --> 00:58:16.534
Phew!

525
00:58:18.536 --> 00:58:19.954
by the way

526
00:58:21.414 --> 00:58:23.750
I will no longer be a film critic.

527
00:58:23.833 --> 00:58:24.667
What?

528
00:58:24.751 --> 00:58:26.753
I don't want to watch movies anymore.

529
00:58:28.254 --> 00:58:32.842
Once we talked about it,
why didn't you write a review for my movie?

530
00:58:33.843 --> 00:58:35.261
- I wrote.
- What?

531
00:58:35.345 --> 00:58:37.764
When? Where? I didn't see it.

532
00:58:37.847 --> 00:58:39.015
Do you want to see?

533
00:58:43.895 --> 00:58:46.189
She is at home. Tell you?

534
00:58:46.272 --> 00:58:48.525
No, thank you. I don't want to know.

535
00:58:48.608 --> 00:58:50.652
- No, I will tell you.
- No, you don't have to.

536
00:58:50.735 --> 00:58:52.070
- Listen.
- No need.

537
00:58:52.153 --> 00:58:53.988
- First...
- Stop it.

538
00:58:54.072 --> 00:58:55.990
When I first saw the movie…

539
00:58:56.783 --> 00:58:58.701
- Wow...
- Stop it. I will be upset.

540
00:58:58.785 --> 00:59:00.620
- I will tell only good things.
- Really?

541
00:59:00.703 --> 00:59:01.955
Yes, only good.

542
00:59:02.038 --> 00:59:06.543
<i>In childhood</i>
<i>I wanted to become 20 years old overnight.</i>

543
00:59:08.211 --> 00:59:09.546
<i>Just like in the movies.</i>

544
00:59:19.556 --> 00:59:23.810
<i>Because childhood did not help</i>
<i>to overcome difficulties.</i>

545
00:59:26.646 --> 00:59:31.276
<i>When I turned 20,</i>
<i>I quickly wanted to turn 30.</i>

546
00:59:32.485 --> 00:59:34.696
<i>I thought I had to pass</i>

547
00:59:34.779 --> 00:59:37.115
<i>stage of inexperience,</i>
<i>to become insensitive to pain.</i>

548
00:59:38.491 --> 00:59:41.995
<i>But even when I turned 30</i>
<i>nothing has changed.</i>

549
00:59:43.705 --> 00:59:48.459
<i>I just started to miss the moments,</i>
<i>that, as I once hoped, a quick minute.</i>

550
00:59:49.836 --> 00:59:51.212
<i>Then I understood,</i>

551
00:59:52.088 --> 00:59:56.384
<i>that every moment I live</i>
<i>continues my life.</i>

552
01:00:07.186 --> 01:00:11.024
<i>Now I will live every moment to the fullest.</i>

553
01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:18.114
<i>Because life is not a movie, but reality.</i>

554
01:00:19.907 --> 01:00:22.660
1 YEAR AND 6 MONTHS LATER

555
01:00:24.787 --> 01:00:28.791
<i>That's why I'm here.</i>

556
01:00:29.876 --> 01:00:32.045
I had to find a job.

557
01:00:37.383 --> 01:00:39.135
And what was the question?

558
01:00:39.802 --> 01:00:41.054
Mr. Co.

559
01:00:41.137 --> 01:00:44.432
You applied knowing that
what does our company do?

560
01:00:44.515 --> 01:00:46.559
Yes, this is a travel agency.

561
01:00:47.477 --> 01:00:49.479
- You studied only at school.
- Yes.

562
01:00:49.562 --> 01:00:52.899
But I think my level of experience
higher than others.

563
01:00:54.942 --> 01:00:57.612
- Do you know foreign languages?
- No.

564
01:00:57.695 --> 01:01:01.616
But I watched a lot
foreign films since I was little…

565
01:01:03.368 --> 01:01:05.495
so, I guess I'll manage.

566
01:01:08.331 --> 01:01:10.333
Chinese, English and…

567
01:01:12.669 --> 01:01:13.670
Thank you

568
01:01:26.265 --> 01:01:27.100
Yes.

569
01:01:29.602 --> 01:01:31.854
I was on top. I'm going home already.

570
01:01:32.355 --> 01:01:34.190
See you at home.

571
01:01:39.237 --> 01:01:41.823
{\an8}THE MOVIE "MELODY"

572
01:01:41.906 --> 01:01:42.907
{\an8}"MELODY", 2024

573
01:01:43.491 --> 01:01:46.661
<i>Kim Muba managed to make a movie.</i>

574
01:01:47.787 --> 01:01:50.957
<i>And he failed.</i>

575
01:01:52.208 --> 01:01:56.462
<i>No, I wouldn't say it's a failure.</i>
<i>How to explain?</i>

576
01:01:59.132 --> 01:02:03.970
<i>Mubi made quite an artistic film,</i>
<i>which was very unlike her.</i>

577
01:02:08.224 --> 01:02:09.225
Thank you

578
01:02:09.308 --> 01:02:12.145
<i>But the strangest thing is that...</i>

579
01:02:12.228 --> 01:02:15.148
Finally, say something to your fans.

580
01:02:17.483 --> 01:02:19.986
Perhaps persistence is my only strength.

581
01:02:20.069 --> 01:02:22.196
<i>…Hong Si Chun succeeded.</i>

582
01:02:22.280 --> 01:02:25.450
Thank you so much for your love and support.

583
01:02:26.325 --> 01:02:29.412
<i>It rarely happens that the soundtrack</i>
<i>more popular than the movie.</i>

584
01:02:29.495 --> 01:02:31.622
- I'm Hong Si Chun.
- Thank you.

585
01:02:31.706 --> 01:02:34.500
<i>But Xi Chun succeeded.</i>

586
01:02:36.085 --> 01:02:36.919
shall we go

587
01:02:43.134 --> 01:02:44.302
Goodbye.

588
01:02:45.803 --> 01:02:47.638
Well, you're a contagion.

589
01:02:47.722 --> 01:02:50.475
And this, in your opinion, is successful,
but anonymous author?

590
01:02:50.558 --> 01:02:52.727
You crave attention.

591
01:02:52.810 --> 01:02:53.644
why are you here

592
01:02:53.728 --> 01:02:55.188
Are you really not coming?

593
01:02:55.271 --> 01:02:58.024
There will be a lot of meat,
and you have to fry it.

594
01:02:58.107 --> 01:03:00.693
And don't get your hopes up, you fool.

595
01:03:00.777 --> 01:03:02.779
Why? Through Chu Ah?

596
01:03:02.862 --> 01:03:05.823
Do you want me to put
a partition between you?

597
01:03:05.907 --> 01:03:08.367
Shut up. I can't because I have plans.

598
01:03:09.076 --> 01:03:12.330
There are some troubles because of you.
Maybe you will be together again?

599
01:03:12.413 --> 01:03:14.749
My hands are slippery.

600
01:03:14.832 --> 01:03:16.876
I'm going Lock the door when you leave.

601
01:03:26.052 --> 01:03:27.220
I'm dreaming

602
01:03:27.303 --> 01:03:30.515
I won't come. I have to finish my work.

603
01:03:31.098 --> 01:03:32.683
What? why don't you come

604
01:03:33.810 --> 01:03:36.312
wait Are you still writing scripts?

605
01:03:36.854 --> 01:03:38.356
Anyone else want them?

606
01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:41.192
disappear I'm writing even more this time.

607
01:03:41.776 --> 01:03:44.654
Maybe you're avoiding your ex too?

608
01:03:44.737 --> 01:03:47.073
What are you talking about? I really have a job.

609
01:03:48.032 --> 01:03:49.450
Can I invite Hounshee?

610
01:03:49.534 --> 01:03:52.703
Be impartial
and don't invite any of us, okay?

611
01:03:52.787 --> 01:03:55.623
He still wouldn't come.
He is very busy.

612
01:03:56.249 --> 01:03:59.085
And how do you feel about your ex?
succeeded? Are you jealous?

613
01:03:59.168 --> 01:04:02.004
Yes, I'm jealous. bye

614
01:04:08.845 --> 01:04:12.849
<i>Chu A was jealous,</i>
<i>because her story was overshadowed by music.</i>

615
01:04:13.766 --> 01:04:15.810
<i>Life is sometimes surprising.</i>

616
01:04:23.317 --> 01:04:24.235
<i>Oh yes.</i>

617
01:04:25.444 --> 01:04:27.613
<i>And I have someone who bores me at home.</i>

618
01:04:27.697 --> 01:04:28.614
Gomm!

619
01:04:33.244 --> 01:04:35.830
Why so long? We have a lot of work to do.

620
01:04:35.913 --> 01:04:36.831
take it

621
01:04:39.834 --> 01:04:43.004
<i>Not a neighbor, but rather a dependent student.</i>

622
01:04:43.588 --> 01:04:46.424
<i>I let him move in,</i>
<i>because I had a spare room,</i>

623
01:04:47.800 --> 01:04:49.010
<i>but now I regret it.</i>

624
01:04:50.636 --> 01:04:52.471
You have already done everything.

625
01:04:53.681 --> 01:04:56.434
Goem, you know
how hard was it to do everything yourself?

626
01:04:56.517 --> 01:04:58.769
We already are.

627
01:04:59.896 --> 01:05:01.230
How is the interview?

628
01:05:01.314 --> 01:05:02.648
Perfectly.

629
01:05:02.732 --> 01:05:05.359
I think I will get a job.

630
01:05:05.443 --> 01:05:08.362
You study in the evenings.
Why are you torturing yourself?

631
01:05:08.446 --> 01:05:11.032
I know I am a diligent guy.

632
01:05:12.325 --> 01:05:13.242
Mubi forcing?

633
01:05:13.326 --> 01:05:14.702
- No, I...
- Yes.

634
01:05:15.578 --> 01:05:16.662
No.

635
01:05:17.246 --> 01:05:18.164
Yes!

636
01:05:19.040 --> 01:05:21.042
When did I force you?

637
01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.794
This is your life. Do whatever you want.

638
01:05:25.212 --> 01:05:27.465
I took fresh meat.

639
01:05:27.548 --> 01:05:31.427
If you need someone
who will replace you in the butcher shop,

640
01:05:31.510 --> 01:05:33.220
what do you think of my candidacy?

641
01:05:33.304 --> 01:05:35.348
- Find a job.
- Yes.

642
01:05:37.141 --> 01:05:38.726
<i>And something important.</i>

643
01:05:38.809 --> 01:05:41.479
I ask for your attention.

644
01:05:41.562 --> 01:05:43.814
The investor came.

645
01:05:44.690 --> 01:05:47.526
<i>The premiere of the movie Mubi took place by a miracle</i>

646
01:05:47.610 --> 01:05:50.363
<i>thanks to the rich director,</i>
<i>who had nothing to do.</i>

647
01:05:50.446 --> 01:05:52.198
I am very glad to see you.

648
01:05:53.115 --> 01:05:53.950
What is the matter with him?

649
01:05:54.033 --> 01:05:57.036
I'm here to celebrate
the success of director Kim…

650
01:05:57.119 --> 01:05:59.330
<i>He suddenly announced that he was a producer</i>

651
01:05:59.413 --> 01:06:02.541
<i>which supports the dreams of young directors.</i>

652
01:06:03.042 --> 01:06:06.879
<i>He starts everything over and in his own way.</i>

653
01:06:07.505 --> 01:06:09.840
Let me share the joy with you.

654
01:06:10.716 --> 01:06:13.094
- Do you know how to fry meat?
- Me?

655
01:06:13.177 --> 01:06:14.553
- Jung Hoo, let's go.
- Good.

656
01:06:14.637 --> 01:06:16.806
- I need to wash the salad.
- Salad.

657
01:06:17.932 --> 01:06:20.351
Mr. Ma, hold on.

658
01:06:24.271 --> 01:06:26.023
- The culprit is the holiday!
- Thank you.

659
01:06:26.107 --> 01:06:27.108
Please.

660
01:06:28.943 --> 01:06:29.860
Cheers.

661
01:06:29.944 --> 01:06:31.779
Thank you. Congratulations.

662
01:06:36.075 --> 01:06:37.076
- Good.
- True?

663
01:06:40.162 --> 01:06:40.997
Very good.

664
01:06:41.998 --> 01:06:42.832
The meat is excellent.

665
01:06:44.959 --> 01:06:45.960
Deliciously.

666
01:06:46.460 --> 01:06:48.462
{\an8}"MELODY"
LIMITED QUANTITY

667
01:06:51.298 --> 01:06:53.050
{\an8}THE MOST CHARMING MELODY OF THE SUMMER

668
01:06:58.848 --> 01:07:01.267
I knew I could spot talent.

669
01:07:29.962 --> 01:07:30.838
Hello.

670
01:07:41.098 --> 01:07:43.267
{\an8}DIRECTOR KIM MUBY

671
01:07:50.441 --> 01:07:53.360
<i>Ko Geum is not watching movies now.</i>

672
01:07:54.779 --> 01:07:59.075
<i>But sometimes he goes with me to the shooting</i>
<i>the field is boring as it is now.</i>

673
01:07:59.909 --> 01:08:04.413
<i>According to him, Kim Mubi -</i>
<i>this is the only film in his life.</i>

674
01:08:12.254 --> 01:08:13.255
what are you doing

675
01:08:14.590 --> 01:08:16.342
This is my storyboard.

676
01:08:16.425 --> 01:08:19.386
Mubi, when the main character cries,

677
01:08:19.470 --> 01:08:21.889
make a general plan instead of a macro plan...

678
01:08:21.972 --> 01:08:24.642
I asked not to interfere in my work.

679
01:08:24.725 --> 01:08:26.977
Your previous work was excellent,

680
01:08:27.061 --> 01:08:29.980
but you should be more sensitive...

681
01:08:30.064 --> 01:08:31.565
- Are you looking for death?
- What?

682
01:08:31.649 --> 01:08:33.692
What are you, a film critic?

683
01:08:35.945 --> 01:08:40.157
<i>When I'm with Gyom, we still switch genres.</i>

684
01:08:40.241 --> 01:08:41.742
<i>Sometimes it is a tearful drama.</i>

685
01:08:41.826 --> 01:08:44.620
<i>Sometimes a touching family film.</i>

686
01:08:45.121 --> 01:08:48.207
<i>And sometimes a completely pointless action movie.</i>

687
01:08:49.375 --> 01:08:53.003
I'm just expressing my humble opinion
as one of the spectators.

688
01:08:53.087 --> 01:08:55.339
What are you talking about? Give it back!

689
01:08:56.340 --> 01:08:57.591
Wait!

690
01:09:14.567 --> 01:09:15.901
Hello,

691
01:09:15.985 --> 01:09:20.990
girl pretending to be evil
but actually very good.

692
01:09:21.574 --> 01:09:24.535
<i>But the best of them…</i>

693
01:09:33.919 --> 01:09:35.004
<i>melodrama.</i>

694
01:10:32.019 --> 01:10:37.733
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

